    "body": "## Description\n\nCreate a `docs/roadmap.md` file capturing the project's phased development plan.\n\n## Steps to Complete\n\n1. Create `docs/roadmap.md`.\n2. Add a markdown table with these columns: `Phase`, `Goal`, `Key Deliverables`.\n3. Fill the rows with the following phases:\n   - Phase 0 - Foundation\n   - Phase 1 - Minimal Browser\n   - Phase 2 - CSS & Layout\n   - Phase 3 - JavaScript\n   - Phase 4 - Multi-Process\n   - Phase 5 - Polish\n4. Add a short intro paragraph explaining that this is a living document.\n5. Link to it from `README.md` (already present - verify the link works).\n6. Commit with `docs: add project roadmap`.\n\n## Learning Outcomes\n\n- Understanding of phased software development.\n- Writing a technical roadmap.\n\n## Helpful Resources\n\n- [Chromium Project Roadmap](https://www.chromium.org/developers/calendar)\n- [Rust Project Roadmap](https://roadmap.sh/rust)\n",
